UID:edf12b8b955173cdd1727210c6b2cbff70bd5fd8@pushpin.city
DTSTAMP:20261004T001530Z
DTSTART:20261006T223000Z
DTEND:20261007T003000Z
SUMMARY:Behind the Screen: Primetime
LOCATION:West Newton Cinema\, 1296 Washington St\, Newton\, MA 02465
DESCRIPTION:Primetime is a 2026 American psychological crime thriller film 
 directed by Lance Oppenheim in his narrative feature film debut. Based on 
 the 2007 Esquire article "Tonight on Dateline This Man Will Die" by Luke D
 ittrich\, the film follows the production of the reality television series
  To Catch a Predator. Robert Pattinson stars as series host Chris Hansen\,
  and also serves as a producer. Merritt Wever\, Skyler Gisondo\, and Phoeb
 e Bridgers play supporting roles.\nhttps://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/
 behind-the-screen-primetime\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/bos
 ton/
URL:https://www.westnewtoncinema.com/movie/behind-the-screen-primetime
END:VEVENT
